\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces AgentHeal architecture. (Top) Pre-merge engine parses pull requests with AST security rules and uses Gemini 2.0 Flash to draft fixes if the score fails our quality gate. (Middle) Central event bus tracks cluster topology. (Bottom) Runtime engine flags anomalies in 2.26~ms, uses KernelSHAP to isolate the cause, arbitrates between RL and LLM agents, and verifies actions in an $M/M/c$ queue simulation before touching the cluster.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{4}{AgentHeal architecture. (Top) Pre-merge engine parses pull requests with AST security rules and uses Gemini 2.0 Flash to draft fixes if the score fails our quality gate. (Middle) Central event bus tracks cluster topology. (Bottom) Runtime engine flags anomalies in 2.26~ms, uses KernelSHAP to isolate the cause, arbitrates between RL and LLM agents, and verifies actions in an $M/M/c$ queue simulation before touching the cluster}{figure.1}{}}
